# Story page: core
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = The First Apple Core
---
Deep in the starving dream, a single apple core lay in the dust like a clue nobody wanted.

The bite marks matched {name}'s exactly. But {name} had never eaten this apple, not in this life, and I would prefer not to discuss the others.

It was the first apple, the one that began everything, kept safe all this time. I suspect I am the one who kept it. I cannot prove it, and I have chosen not to try.
